(7582703, 1219018, 194290, '<td valign="top">yes, you are right. i should have gone with the tighter version for this challenge. <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Pangurban:</b></div><hr/><i> I love the boats in this and its a great landscape.  Having said that, I Think Id have preferred a tighter crop for this particular challenge with more emphasis on the town than the sea. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'yes, you are right. i should have gone with the tighter version for this challenge. Originally posted by Pangurban: I love the boats in this and its a great landscape.  Having said that, I Think Id have preferred a tighter crop for this particular challenge with more emphasis on the town than the sea. ', '2018-07-16 05:12:54.000000', NULL, 0),
